# Sakana AI's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-sakana-setting-cookie = Sign in to https://console.sakana.ai, open Developer Tools > Application > Cookies for https://console.sakana.ai, and copy every cookie there (the sign-in session cookies are required). Paste them as "name=value; name2=value2"; the Cookie header of a request to console.sakana.ai/billing in the Network tab also works.

## The report: the pay-as-you-go credit balance and spend. The plan card's
## name and price, and the page's date range, stay as Sakana shows them.

usage-sakana-credit-balance = Credit balance
usage-sakana-pay-as-you-go-usage = Pay-as-you-go usage
usage-sakana-pay-as-you-go = Pay as you go
# The date range the spend covers, such as Jun 02, 2026 - Jul 01, 2026.
usage-sakana-usage-period = Usage period
